# The multitasking switcher on the PDA profile with the writing zone (report 041): the switcher screen in the app area
# above the band (the multitasking size rule keeps using the panel, 480 px short side), its targets at least 7 mm and
# inside the app area; and the screensaver drawing the band black with the rest (the clock in the app area).
# Goldens at both sizes.
title zone switcher
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png"
clock 21:07 2026-10-10
wifi 70
bt on
config dark_time 10
home
switcher "Mesh Hop=front" "RSS Reader=running" "Net Toolbox=paused"
shot zone_switcher
expect_targets
switcher off
screensaver
wait 10600
shot zone_screensaver
